              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kapaaran kaŋin eraun atenut naka EJAKAIT naejok ido nakaibuses, eraunos da araito nuka akwap nukeitur nuejijimikinete ŋul luekuito luka Isirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kosodi kanen, ŋol loideuna koSion, ka ŋol loesalakinit Yerusalem enyarao lokalaunan, ŋes ŋinituŋanan yeniwadikatai araut yenikajaran koYerusalem: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naedaunia EJAKAIT ailotar amodokok kere naka apesur nuka Sion, aitesegar da aokot nuka Yerusalem kokidiŋike, kanuka emoyo loka etube, ido kanuka emoyo loka aicwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:5"
          },
